            (2 * TaoFivePrimes.twinPrimeConstant)) / (16 * z ^ 2)))
        ≤ ∑ q ∈ Finset.Icc 1 ⌊z⌋₊,
          (if Squarefree q then
            ∏ p ∈ q.primeFactors, if p = 2 then (1 : ℝ) else 2 / ((p : ℝ) - 2)
          else 0) / (1 + (q : ℝ) / z) := solution

#print axioms solution
